foundation.question_text:
How many lines of symmetry does this square have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3,3);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How many lines of symmetry does this non-square rectangle have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4.5,2.5);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How many lines of symmetry does this non-square rhombus have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,-1.8) -- (2.8,0) -- (0,1.8) -- (-2.8,0) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How many lines of symmetry does this kite have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,-2.2) -- (1.7,0.6) -- (0,2.2) -- (-1.7,0.6) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How many lines of symmetry does this general parallelogram have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (4,0) -- (5.2,2.4) -- (1.2,2.4) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this non-square rectangle?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4.8,2.2);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

development.question_text:
What is the order of rotational symmetry of this square?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3.2,3.2);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this non-square rhombus?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,-1.7) -- (3,0) -- (0,1.7) -- (-3,0) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this kite?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,-2.4) -- (1.8,0.5) -- (0,2) -- (-1.8,0.5) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

State both the number of lines of symmetry and the order of rotational symmetry of this parallelogram.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (4.2,0) -- (5.4,2.2) -- (1.2,2.2) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

In this rectangle, which labelled segments are lines of symmetry: $AC$, $BD$, $EF$ or $GH$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0); \coordinate (B) at (5,0); \coordinate (C) at (5,2.6); \coordinate (D) at (0,2.6);
\coordinate (E) at (2.5,0); \coordinate (F) at (2.5,2.6); \coordinate (G) at (0,1.3); \coordinate (H) at (5,1.3);
\draw (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- (D) -- cycle;
\draw[dashed] (A) -- (C); \draw[dashed] (B) -- (D); \draw[dashed] (E) -- (F); \draw[dashed] (G) -- (H);
\node[below left] at (A) {$A$}; \node[below right] at (B) {$B$}; \node[above right] at (C) {$C$}; \node[above left] at (D) {$D$};
\node[below] at (E) {$E$}; \node[above] at (F) {$F$}; \node[left] at (G) {$G$}; \node[right] at (H) {$H$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
